From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DerpFest Developer <dev@derpfest.org>
Date: Mon, 1 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: Add iPadOS style split shade Control Center

- Split status bar pulldown gestures:
  * Top-Right corner (last 25% of screen width) opens the Control Center / Quick Settings.
  * Top-Left / Center (first 75% of screen width) opens the Notification Shade.
- Implement iPadOS modular control layout:
  * 2x2 Connectivity matrix (Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, Airplane Mode, Cellular Data)
  * Vertical hardware-accelerated brightness and volume slider controls
  * 2x2 media playback widget
  * Circular and pill action toggles with liquid glass blur backdrops
- Hardware-accelerated Skia / RenderEffect blur on shade expansion.
